    "body": "Private sf0.5 context is now recorded in sf0.8/docs/ci/rung-public-origin-context-2026-09-14.md. Historical evidence shows the public Rung path used a laptop-hosted Docker Compose serving chain behind Cloudflare Tunnel; INC-107 separated the connector and added restart protection, and later evidence recorded HTTP 200. The current 530 is therefore a likely origin/serving regression, not evidence that the Python artifacts require Docker. Exact Cloudflare origin state remains owner-only and unverified.",
