    "body": "Verification 5-Whys for the transient check failure: 1) The first link workflow reported 404 for /rung/. 2) Pages had not finished publishing the pushed SHA. 3) The workflow was manually dispatched while Pages was still building. 4) The monitor had no propagation retry. Root cause: deployment/check timing race, not a missing source file. Immediate correction: waited for Pages and confirmed 200. Recurrence guard: bounded retries in scripts/check_public_links.py; the next workflow passed.",
